"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 4"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Liquidify/Screenshots/5.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 5"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 8,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Comprehensive glass coating:** Applies a hazy liquid glass effect to Control Center, Notifications, the Dock, Dynamic Island, Keyboard, Widgets, Folders and the Lock Screen.\n- **Glass customization:** Fine-tune parameters such as blur intensity, transparency and light refraction.\n- **Lock Screen beautification:** Change the clock font as you like (supports loading .ttf files) and easily adjust font size and transparency.\n- **Dynamic Island coloring:** Supports blending up to 5 gradient colors for an eye-catching color transition effect.\n- **Keyboard & Control Center:** Soft rounded corners, forced Dark Mode or an exclusive personal wallpaper.\n- **High compatibility:** Runs smoothly without conflicting with popular tweaks such as TrollOpen, BarGesture and Kayoko.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
